# Pre-commit / pre-push GitHub checks

Repo: [Marfa/ghost-img-proxy](https://github.com/Marfa/ghost-img-proxy).

## Before every `git commit` that will be pushed (and before every `git push`)

1. **Open PRs** — review and handle https://github.com/Marfa/ghost-img-proxy/pulls  
   (`gh pr list`, review/merge/close/comment as needed; do not leave blocking open work ignored).

2. **Security / Dependabot** — check and process all of:
   - https://github.com/Marfa/ghost-img-proxy/security/malware
   - https://github.com/Marfa/ghost-img-proxy/security/dependabot
   - https://github.com/Marfa/ghost-img-proxy/security/code-scanning
   - https://github.com/Marfa/ghost-img-proxy/security/secret-scanning  
   (`gh api` alerts; fix code, bump deps, dismiss with reason, or open/merge fix PR).

Do not commit/push until open PRs and security alerts are consciously handled (fixed, merged, or explicitly deferred with a note to the user).

## After every `git push`

1. Watch https://github.com/Marfa/ghost-img-proxy/actions (`gh run list` / `gh run watch`).
2. Drive failed workflows to **green**: read failed logs, fix root cause, push follow-up, re-check until Actions succeed (or report a blocker that needs the user).

## Commands (typical)

```bash
gh pr list --repo Marfa/ghost-img-proxy
gh api "/repos/Marfa/ghost-img-proxy/dependabot/alerts?state=open"
gh api "/repos/Marfa/ghost-img-proxy/code-scanning/alerts?state=open"
gh api "/repos/Marfa/ghost-img-proxy/secret-scanning/alerts?state=open"
gh run list --repo Marfa/ghost-img-proxy --limit 10
gh run watch <run-id> --repo Marfa/ghost-img-proxy
gh run view <run-id> --repo Marfa/ghost-img-proxy --log-failed
```

## Secrets

Never commit VPS public IPs, SSH keys, or Cloudflare tokens. Resolve the VPS address from `bot.themarfa.name` / `VPS_HOST` / env at runtime.
